# Training Figures Directory

This directory contains trajectory prediction comparison figures from experimental training runs.

## Faculty-Approved Figures

The following figures are referenced in TRAINING_HANDOFF.md:

1. `trajectory-baseline-2d-collide-pred-vs-gt.png` - Collision avoidance results
2. `trajectory-baseline-2d-path-pred-vs-gt.png` - Empty-scene path results
3. `trajectory-baseline-2d-collide-empty-pred-vs-gt.png` - Contrast experiment
4. `trajectory-baseline-2d-combo-pred-vs-gt.png` - Contrast experiment (failed)

**Note:** The PNG files were attached to the task that created the training handoff and should be manually placed in this directory.
